WEBVTT

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.530
You don't even listen and you suddenly raise your hand at him!

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:41.830
That's not good!

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.290
Your mama says she's sleepy, boy.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.600
Come play with, Morio.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:43.240
Okay.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.730
Hurry up, boy! Hurry!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.140
Several huge typhoons would pass.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.210
I would become cramped as I grew taller.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:16.860
The time mom spent napping became longer little by little.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:24.170
Pote 24

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:24.170
Flower

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.810
So what should we play?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.120
Anything is fine.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:36.030
Then let's play something sensei taught Morio.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.200
Okay. What kind of game?

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.130
Sumo wrestling.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.000
Hakke-yoi.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.630
Hold on.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:46.880
What is it?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.410
You won't play seriously?

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.290
Yeah, I won't, I won't.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.280
I'll only be half serious.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.840
Could you make it half of that half seriousness?

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.420
Okay, I will.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:57.310
Okay, then.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.410
Hakke-yoi...nokotta!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.080
Suppari!

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.880
I'm sorry, boy.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.600
I'll only be half, half, half, half serious next time.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:28.920
Morio was part of the staff for dad's work.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.630
He would take care of us and our belongings.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:37.400
He was an important friend who would always smile, eat a lot and talk a lot.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.950
Are you doing your Japanese lessons again, boy?

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.480
Yeah. Let's do it together, Morio.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:51.550
Morio can now write a lot of Japanese.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:55.230
It's all thanks to you for making this.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.830
So it's useful?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:02.360
Of course! That's why I'm writing a letter.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.170
To who?

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.450
To Morio's mom.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.160
Mama, are you doing well

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.830
Mama will get my Japanese letter and she'll be surprised and smiling!

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.920
And she won't be able to read it.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.980
Do you want to write one too?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.680
Mama-san will smile a lot!

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:22.500
Tell her you love her.

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:25.710
Tell her you want to kiss her.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.860
To mom

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:44.380
Sunao.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.310
You're there, right?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:48.750
Sunao!

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:55.460
I need something from you so come here, Sunao.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.910
Sit here.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.090
It's okay, just hurry up!

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:09.390
Come on.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.040
What did you need?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.700
Read it to me!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.210
Hey, hey, read it!

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.810
Didn't you just read it yourself earlier?

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.120
Read it!

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.160
I got it. You just want me to read it, right?

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.030
Yep. Quickly, quickly!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.370
Dear mom,

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:35.890
Today I went to the hill in the south with Morio.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:40.090
There were many blooming flowers.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.490
I want to go with you next time, mom.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:50.030
Hey, Sunao. Let's make dinner together tonight.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.470
But...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.890
It's okay, it's okay!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.840
I'm feeling really well today.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.600
I'm going to go all out!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:01.820
Pots, pots...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.060
Mama-san. Mama-san!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.350
I'm okay! Don't worry.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.530
Mama-san! Mama-san!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.380
Just have a seat, mama-san!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.940
He went to sleep before he took a bath?

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.740
He really worked hard making dinner.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.720
He's so small yet he has it all together.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.530
He can do everything by himself now.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.100
You're right.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.680
Is it because of some bad examples?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.370
What are you looking at?

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.260
What is it? What a big kid!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:11.670
Sorry.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:16.590
Stupid.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:20.410
And after the next typhoon had passed,

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.640
mom and I went back home to our country.

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:26.490
In our familiar homeland, we would get proper medical treatment.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.420
I'll try to come back as soon as possible.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.000
Just leave sensei to me!

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:34.400
Write letters, boy!

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:35.860
Morio will write too!

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.360
I'll write for sure!

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.680
Sunao. Hey, Sunao.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.970
Your eyes are too close.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:57.030
The weather is so nice. You should've went out to play.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.220
Can you get up?

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.980
For a walk. I'll get a wheelchair for you.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.450
The peach tree in the back is in full bloom.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.160
How pretty...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.200
Hey, Sunao.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:31.400
I think I like Japan the most after all.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:37.980
Is your mom doing well, boy?

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.940
Morio and Sensei aren't doing well.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.150
We're busy everyday.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.270
That's why the letter was late.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.080
Japan sure is far.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.550
We can't see each other.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:57.640
But I will always remember what you told me.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.430
Always remember.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.320
That's why I don't feel lonely.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:09.810
It's almost time, Sunao, so wait in the car.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.190
He really has it together.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:20.700
He didn't cry one bit and took care of her until the end.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.300
I'm not sure about that.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.430
He is really...

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.830
I just had a nostalgic dream.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:45.070
You've always been late when it comes to crucial moments.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.900
Wai--Wha---We saw the same---

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.200
Suna-o!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.160
It bloomed!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:11.980
Yeah.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:17.930
Su-nao!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.960
Mom must be happy.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:20.650
Yeah.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.200
Good morning!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.000
Morning!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:32.020
How am I supposed to face Moriyama-kun today?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.030
I was thinking about it the whole night and I couldn't sleep.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.990
First, I should apologize for yesterday.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.790
And then, even if just for a little...

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:46.410
What the heck have you been doing since yesterday!?

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.100
Wait! If you strip me now...!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:52.690
You're going to make him your boyfriend, Mikan!?

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:52.700
Moriyama-kun!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:59.250
Kyo-chan, if you don't quickly change and eat, you'll be late!

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:00.160
Okay...

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.120
Dad!

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.850
Okay! I'm already awake.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.200
If you don't hurry up, it'll get cold!

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:09.620
Okay, okay.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:16.350
Guchuko!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.270
S-Sorry.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:26.230
I'm sorry.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.960
Why are you walking so sluggishly, turtle-Mikan!?

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.250
So what is it so early in the morning?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.420
If it isn't, Guchuko-chan!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.180
Welcome!

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.530
Hey, Kyo-chan, what does Guchuko want?

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.670
Well, I don't really know.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.760
Hey, Guchuko-chan.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.130
You're here early.

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.230
Hey, hey.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.240
So, did you want something?

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.200
Did you forget because you were angry?

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.710
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.270
What is it? Ask away.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:37.850
I've always questioned it but, what's inside this box?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:38.930
Rocks.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.430
Mutan...

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.730
I should apologize to him first when I meet him.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.070
Ah, that's not it. I should say, "Good morning" first.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:53.150
Then I should say, "I'm sorry about yesterday".

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.190
What is it, Yasumi?

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:03.950
Moriyama-kun!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.440
I'm sorry!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:15.790
T-T-That's not it!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:17.290
Good sorry!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:18.300
TL: She mixes up "Good morning" with "I'm sorry"

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:20.510
A dialect?

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:27.760
About yesterday...

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.020
Hey, let go, Yasumi!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.400
Yasumi!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:03.760
Let go, Yasumi!

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.340
Yasumi!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:11.690
Moriyama-kun...

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:13.910
Suna...

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:19.820
Su-na...

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:22.780
Pote-chan?

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:29.270
Guchuko?

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:40.760
Pote-chan...

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.300
Potemayo?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.850
What's that?

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:10.070
That's...

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:12.040
Pote-tan?

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:32.880
Hey, Sunao.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:37.750
I think I like Japan the most after all.

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:42.910
Many different kinds of flowers bloom, scatter and bloom once more.

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:44.960
It's very pretty.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.520
Let's stay forever in Japan, mom.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:57.010
Together in this place that you love...

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.050
Pote-chan!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.350
Pote-chan! Hey, Pote-chan!

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:07.210
Open up your eyes, Pote-chan!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.770
Hey, what's wrong, Pote-chan!?

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:19.950
Moriyama-kun...

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.550
No...

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.330
I was able to finally hold you...

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.020
I'm not happy one bit though...

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.980
Yesterday, she told me to say "Thank you".

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:07.870
She kept pushing me to tell you.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:40.710
Potemayo!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:42.940
Pote-tan!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.950
Bread! Bread!! Bread! Bread! Bread, bread, bread, bread!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:53.030
Bread! Bread! Bread, bread, bread!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:56.790
Anko! Anko! Anko! Anko! Anko, anko, anko, anko!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:00.200
Anko! Anko! Anko, anko, anko!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.130
Good going, mochi-mochi! You're so popular!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.020
Mutan! Let's sing together, Mutan!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:07.340
Jam! Jam! Jam! Jam! Jam, jam, jam, jam!

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:07.340
Idiot! It's embarrassing!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:10.520
Jam! Jam! Jam bread, bread!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.460
You want more?

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:14.220
Roll! Roll! Roll! Roll! Roll, roll, roll, roll!

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:13.550
Here.

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:17.470
Roll! Roll! Bread roll, bread!

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.770
Guchuko! Don't cause too much trouble!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:24.790
I love! I love! I love! I love! I love bread!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.030
Let's eat bread!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:33.010
That was an embarrassing misunderstanding, huh?

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.860
Well, I'm glad it turned out to be a misunderstanding.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.500
Yasumi! Kyo said she'd give me truffles!

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:49.860
Hey! It's dangerous if you don't watch where you're going.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.010
It's okay if you understand.

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.720
Thanks for listening to our duet!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.830
Next, let's sing the pudding song!

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:08.690
What!?

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:16.270
Light! A-Airy! L-Light and A-Airy!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:22.580
Pudding! Pudding! Pudding! Sticky, creamy pudding! That's pudding!

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:30.000
Pudding! Pudding! Pudding! Mutan! Sticky, creamy pudding! That's pudding!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.930
Sunao! Where do I put burnable trash?

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:43.390
Potemayo.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.310
Alright then...

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.090
Potemayo! Potemayo.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:35.920
Hey, what do you think this is?

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:42.780
You don't know either, Potemayo?

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:45.680
Well, try talking to it first.

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:47.590
We might find out something.
